<title>USA: WebSecure ousts president, CEO.</title>
<headline>WebSecure ousts president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAUGUS, Mass. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>WebSecure Inc said on Tuesday it terminated Tibor Vais as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Vais resigned from WebSecure's board as a director and secretary, WebSecure said.</p>
<p>Carroll Lowenstein, chairman, was named WebSecure's president, the company said.</p>
<p>WebSecure said its board &quot;had decided to direct the company's activities toward areas which required leadership by an individual with a different skill set.&quot;</p>
